# 64-bit floats: arithmetic, min/max/fma, conversions, asdouble/asuint splitting, float-only intrinsics narrowed as DXC does.
# The constant buffer is Gain, pad, Scale, Pair, Seed, 28 bytes of padding, Axis (32-byte aligned).
case types_double_math
shader types/double_math.hlsl
dispatch CSMain 4 1 1
uniform 0 0 : 1.25 0u 0.75d 0.5d -1.25d 5u 0u 0u 0u 0u 0u 0u 0u 0.5d -2.0d 1.5d
storage 0 1 : @f64pm1(3,768)
storage 0 2 out size=6144
storage 0 3 out size=1024
storage 0 4 out size=512
